{"id":"sh/fa5g3qp4","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":64,"top":517,"width":332,"height":236},"text":"detect_lines 检出 8 条线段。\nbind_point_labels 绑定标签，\nG 因缺少附近顶点而未绑定。\n\nCV 结果经 ingest 写入 GES，\nSupervisor 读取结果后委派\nGeometry Agent。","style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#162A40","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
