{"id":"sh/idsv2h4b","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":444,"top":517,"width":332,"height":253},"text":"Geometry 再检查直角与线型。\n未检出方块直角标记。\n\n合并 14 个对象、5 条关系，\n保留 G 未绑定与虚实线争议。\n\nGES 将结构化证据提供给\nTikZ Agent。","style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#162A40","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/5gjudwnm","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":824,"top":466,"width":332,"height":36},"text":"4–5  生成与首轮评审","style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#205EAB","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/4fad4rmh","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":824,"top":517,"width":332,"height":236},"text":"④ TikZ 依据 GES 与指令生成\nv1，翻转像素 y 轴并统一尺度，\n自动编译、渲染与校验通过。\n\n⑤ Critic 对照原图与渲染图，\n指出 FG 虚线缺失（high）、\nG 标签缺失（medium）。","style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#162A40","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/rilcf65s","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":1204,"top":466,"width":332,"height":36},"text":"6–8  修复与归档","style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#205EAB","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/qhsv6147","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":1204,"top":517,"width":332,"height":236},"text":"⑥ Supervisor 沿 AF 外推，\n得到 G≈(448,254) px，委派\nTikZ 补画虚线和标签，编译 v2。\n\n⑦ Critic 确认补全，选择 v2。\n⑧ finish 返回 success，归档\n最佳 tex / PDF / PNG 与日志。","style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#162A40","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
